  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dune de Miel</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Dune de Miel produces and markets natural food products made of ingredients generally known for their nutritional properties. The company currently offers around ten.natural products without additives based on cocoa, coffee, ginger, baobab, petit cola, bissap, and with honey.as the only preservative. Through its grant with USADF, Dune de Miels aims to strengthen its capacity for expansion through: 1) the certification of its products to meet international standards; 2) the development of its branding and marketing approach; and 3) an increase in its production capacity.</narrative>
  </description>
